# Incremental apply hands the projection the stored bytes with the envelope
# still on them (the #5225 characterization of the seam before #5240).
MODULE: QuiescentAtStampedVersionApplySeesEnvelope
TARGET: QuiescentAtStampedVersion
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an ordinary apply projects the enveloped bytes instead of the stripped body
PERTURBS: Apply

--- FIND
           new == Proj(viewDefn, Input(e.vals[k]))
--- REPLACE
           new == Proj(viewDefn, EnvelopeBytes(e.vals[k]))
--- END
